      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The safest tx, but recurr = common and courses are often prolonged; adding a topical to PO therapy may further reduce recurr"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Drying agents help prevent recurr: antifungal powders (eg, miconazole), Burow solution (5% aluminum acetate) soaks, or 20 to 25% aluminum Cl"
     }
    ]
   }
